     "text": "{\"cost\": 5, \"rationale\": \"Cheapest route: supplychain:initialAccess (entry, not counted) -> dmzWeb:exploitPublicApp (1) -> browserStore:credentialAccess (2) -> backupHost:lateralMovement (3, OR) -> shareMount:collection (4) -> crownData:exfiltrate (5). Using iotDevice:execution from internet:initialAccess in place of dmzWeb:exploitPublicApp also gives 5. The other routes cost more. dbReplica:collection and codeRepo:collection both need serviceAccount:privilegeEscalation, an AND of ssoLogin:authenticate and vpnSession:authenticate, which pulls in ciRunner, kerberoast, workstation and configSecret. vaultRead:collection needs secretsManager:privilegeEscalation, an AND of monitoringHost and fileServer, which also requires ssoLogin.\"}"
